# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Dream Halls leaves a spell's normal mana cast available.
# Forcing: Three Islands pay for Wind Drake, so the normal cast is offered beside the alternative cost.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no permanents or hand, so it makes no decisions.
# Card roles:
#   Dream Halls — grants the alternative cost.
#   Wind Drake — cast by paying its mana cost.
#   Opt — a blue card that stays in hand because nothing is discarded.
# Protocol path: normal cast offer, mana payment, resolution.

[metadata]
Name:Dream Halls Mana Cast
Goal:Survive
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Cast Wind Drake by paying its mana cost while Dream Halls is on the battlefield.

